<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Displacement and distance travelled by a particle</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>A particle moves along a straight line. Its displacement from a fixed point \(O\) after \(t\) seconds is \(s = {@s@}\) metres.</p><p>(a) Find the two times when the particle is instantaneously at rest.</p><div>Earlier: \(t =\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] \(\quad\) later: \(t =\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div><p>(b) Find the displacement of the particle from \(O\) when \(t = {@T0@}\).</p><div>[[input:ans3]] m [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div><p>(c) Find the total distance travelled in the first \({@T0@}\) seconds.</p><div>[[input:ans4]] m [[validation:ans4]] [[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>Displacement is where you are; distance is how far you went. The particle can change direction only when it is at rest, so split the motion at those times.</p><p>(a) \(v = \dfrac{ds}{dt} = {@v@} = {@3*a0*(t-p0)*(t-q0)@}\), which is \(0\) at \(t = {@p0@}\) and \(t = {@q0@}\).</p><p>(b) At \(t = {@T0@}\), \(s = {@sT@}\) m.</p><p>(c) The distance moved in each stage is the size of the change in \(s\):</p><table border="1" style="border-collapse:collapse;text-align:center;"><tr><th style="padding:4px 10px;">Stage</th><th style="padding:4px 10px;">Start \(s\) (m)</th><th style="padding:4px 10px;">End \(s\) (m)</th><th style="padding:4px 10px;">Distance moved (m)</th></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\(0\) to \({@p0@}\) s</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\(0\)</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\({@sp@}\)</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\({@abs(sp)@}\)</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\({@p0@}\) to \({@q0@}\) s</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\({@sp@}\)</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\({@sq@}\)</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\({@abs(sq-sp)@}\)</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\({@q0@}\) to \({@T0@}\) s</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\({@sq@}\)</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\({@sT@}\)</td><td style="padding:4px 10px;">\({@abs(sT-sq)@}\)</td></tr></table><p>Total distance \(= {@abs(sp)@} + {@abs(sq-sp)@} + {@abs(sT-sq)@} = {@dist@}\) m.</p><div style="text-align:center;" role="img" aria-label="Graph of s against t for t from 0 to {#T0#}: s rises from 0 to {#sp#} at t = {#p0#}, falls to {#sq#} at t = {#q0#}, then rises to {#sT#} at t = {#T0#}.">
[[jsxgraph width="360px" height="260px"]]
(function() {
  var b = JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(divid, {boundingbox: [-0.8, {#yu#}, {#T0#}+0.8, {#yl#}], axis: true, grid: false, showNavigation: false, showCopyright: false, pan: {enabled: false}, zoom: {enabled: false}});
  // s against t for 0 <= t <= T0
  b.create('functiongraph', [function(x) { return {#a0#}*x*x*x+({#coeff(s,t,2)#})*x*x+({#coeff(s,t,1)#})*x; }, 0, {#T0#}], {strokeColor: '#1f4e9c', strokeWidth: 2, fixed: true, highlight: false});
  b.create('point', [{#p0#}, {#sp#}], {name: '({#p0#}, {#sp#})', size: 3, fixed: true, strokeColor: '#000000', fillColor: '#000000', showInfobox: false, label: {useMathJax: false, offset: [6, 8]}});
  b.create('point', [{#q0#}, {#sq#}], {name: '({#q0#}, {#sq#})', size: 3, fixed: true, strokeColor: '#000000', fillColor: '#000000', showInfobox: false, label: {useMathJax: false, offset: [6, -14]}});
  b.create('point', [{#T0#}, {#sT#}], {name: '({#T0#}, {#sT#})', size: 3, fixed: true, strokeColor: '#000000', fillColor: '#000000', showInfobox: false, label: {useMathJax: false, offset: [-50, 8]}});
})();
[[/jsxgraph]]
</div>]]></text>
